# The signing key itself, not just the properties file pointing at it. Nothing
# stopped a .jks dropped anywhere in the tree from being committed; losing control
# of it means anyone can ship an update signed as KasiGuru, and it cannot be
# rotated for already-installed apps.
*.jks
*.keystore
